\"459202AMMVKLRCTPDPDTNVPVBVKJGNMMV\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-01-07T10:30:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-04-01T10:30:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages \",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Kimi Waxman\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Tuesdays, 7.15pm-9.15pm, £216, in building \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Beginners I with Reuven Vazan [In Building]\",\"instanceDates\":\"7 January-1 April\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"460801AMDHVQNJJCLNJHQCVQRMRRGLTVB\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-01-07T19:15:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-04-01T19:15:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Reuven Vazan \",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Mondays, 12noon -2pm, £216, online\",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Beginners II (Term III) with Matan Rosenstrauch [Online]\",\"instanceDates\":\"6 January-31 March\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"460201ABLVQSHKHRJGPKDLVCPJBGRKBTH\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-01-06T12:00:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-03-31T12:00:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Matan Rosenstrauch\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Wednesdays, 7.15pm-9.15pm, £216, in building\",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Beginners II with Esti Levene [In Building]\",\"instanceDates\":\"8 January-2 April\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"461801AVHLLLMTGCRBGQMNLNCMQNNQVPT\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-01-08T19:15:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-04-02T19:15:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Haggit Inbar-Littas\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Tuesdays 11am - 1pm // \\r\\n6 May 2025\\r\\n-\\r\\n22 July 2025 // \\r\\n£162 for the 9 weeks // Develop your skills in Hebrew calligraphy and artwork inspired by text. Explore colour and design.\\r\\n\\r\\nWork with ink, paint and gold leaf to create beautiful illuminated Hebrew letters, words, quotations and more. All levels welcome!\\r\\n\\r\\nVetta is an artist and calligrapher specialising in Hebrew Calligraphy and painted illumination. She has exhibited widely including at the British Library, The Museum of London and the Jewish Museum.\",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Calligraphy - Summer 2025\",\"instanceDates\":\"6 May-22 July\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"487601AMKLMDRNCNBPLJGDNCDVBLQTVMD\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-05-06T11:00:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-07-22T11:00:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Classes & Courses\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Creative Courses\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Vetta Alexis\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Tuesdays \\r\\n14 January – 18 March* *No class 18 February \\r\\n11am – 1pm  \\r\\n£20 per session or £162 for the 9 weeks \\r\\n\\r\\nDevelop your skills in Hebrew calligraphy and artwork inspired by text. Explore colour and design. \\r\\n\\r\\nWork with ink, paint and gold leaf to create beautiful illuminated Hebrew letters, words, quotations and more. All levels welcome! \\r\\n\\r\\nVetta is an artist and calligrapher specialising in Hebrew Calligraphy and painted illumination. She has exhibited widely including at the British Library, The Museum of London and the Jewish Museum. \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Calligraphy - Winter 2025\",\"instanceDates\":\"14 January-11 March\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"449601ADJKPMHVCHQLJSJLQRBMKQNJKVL\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-01-14T11:00:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-03-11T11:00:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Classes & Courses\",\"attribute_Language\":\"Hebrew\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Adult Education\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Vetta Alexis\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Monday 28 July to Friday 8 August, 10.30am-3.30pm, £390 for the session, must book entire 2 weeks // Our popular Ulpan course is back for the summer with our expert, world-renowned tutors.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis ten-day intensive 40 hour course offers tuition for all levels. So whether you're a complete beginner determined to master the basics, or a confident Hebrew speaker wanting to brush up on your skills, now's your chance to learn from the best teachers around.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou might be keen to learn how to read and write Hebrew in a short space of time. Impress your relative in Israel by holding a conversation with them. Or maybe you're just tired of being taken for a ride (figuratively and literally) by over-priced Israeli taxi drivers and want to negotiate a better fare. \\r\\n\\r\\nWhatever your reason, seize the opportunity this summer and sign up for an Ulpan course you won't forget. You'll be amazed how quickly your skills improve.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease note, this course must be booked for the full 2 weeks. Following your booking, we will be in touch to assess your level before the course begins. \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":300,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Intensive Summer Ulpan\",\"instanceDates\":\"28 July-8 August\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"494601AJQDHJMSGCPCGQNKPBDQPRJLDLM\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-07-28T10:30:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-08-08T10:30:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Wednesdays, 7.15pm-9.15pm, £220, online // \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Intermediate 1 (Term 2) with Rina Wolgroch-Zolty [Online]\",\"instanceDates\":\"23 April-16 July\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"496801AGKDJNVPKGMDMJTNQPPVCSPTSTH\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-04-23T19:15:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-07-16T19:15:00\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"Rina Wolgroch-Zolty\",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\"},{\"description\":\"Mondays, 10.30am-12.30pm, £200 (10 weeks), in building \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":120,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Intermediate 1 (Term 3) with Haggit Inbar-Littas\",\"instanceDates\":\"28 April-21 July\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"486001AGTGSJSQSQRQMDCTNTLQKHRTRTP\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2025-04-28T10:30:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\