\n              </li>\n          <li> Holy Cow</li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid align-end\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-lg-6 offset-lg-1\">\n\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHoly Cow\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                      2024\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>92 minutes</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Rating TBC</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><time datetime=\"2025-04-27T18:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">27 April 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-01T12:40:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">1 May 2025</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£9 / £15</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n        <div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 m-banner__links\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/EventAvailability?EventId=498602&amp;ref=bookNow&amp;scroll=timeAndDates\" class=\"use-ajax a-btn\" data-dialog-type=\"modal\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;height&quot;:&quot;70%&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:&quot;80%&quot;}\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t          <aside class=\"a-wishlist\"><span class=\"a-wishlist__msg\"></span><button class=\"a-wishlist__button\" title=\"Add to wishlist\" data-target=\"4415\">Add to wishlist</button></aside>\n        </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"m-banner__image a-image a-image--full\">\n\t\t\t\n\n<picture>\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_sm/public/images/Holy%20Cow.jpg?itok=RspkmE4d\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 1000px)\" data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_md/public/images/Holy%20Cow.jpg?itok=vEJmwJb3\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image/public/images/Holy%20Cow.jpg?itok=WvNbO91b\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t<img data-src=\"\" alt=\"Holy Cow\" class=\"lazy lazy-animate\" />\n</picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"m-sticky-header\">\n\t<div class=\"grid justify-center\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"m-sticky-header__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Holy Cow</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><time datetime=\"2025-04-27T18:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">27 April 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-01T12:40:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">1 May 2025</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£9 / £15</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/EventAvailability?EventId=498602&amp;ref=bookNow&amp;scroll=timeAndDates\" class=\"use-ajax a-btn\" data-dialog-type=\"modal\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;height&quot;:&quot;70%&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:&quot;80%&quot;}\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-8 col-lg-6 order-1 order-sm-0 offset-lg-1\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-entity m-entity__body\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>A farmer's son must suddenly step up to his responsibilities in this debut from Louise Courvoisier set in rural France.</p>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<section class=\"m-entity m-entity__video\">\n\n  \n    <h3 class=\"a-title\">Holy Cow<span>&#x25A0;</span></h3>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"video-embed-field-provider-youtube video-embed-field-responsive-video\"><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NVF7ThVdWFY?autoplay=0&amp;start=0&amp;rel=0\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"m-entity m-entity__accordion\">\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"js-accordion\">\n    <p class=\"js-accordion__header h3\">Credits</p>\n<div class=\"js-accordion__panel\">\n\t<p><strong>Rating:</strong> TBC<br />\n<strong>Genre:</strong> Comedy, Drama <br />\n<strong>Director: </strong>Louise Courvoisier <br />\n<strong>Stars:</strong> Clément Faveau, Maïwene Barthelemy, Luna Garret</p>\n\n</div>\n<p class=\"js-accordion__header h3\">Synopsis</p>\n<div class=\"js-accordion__panel\">\n\t<p>After the tragic death of his father, 18 year old Totone is thrust into the unexpected and very adult role of looking after his younger sister and their failing family farm in the Jura section of France. He assumes even more responsibility when he enters a cash competition for the best Comte cheese made in this western part of the French Alps. A \"verité\" look at the hardscrabble life of French agriculture, it is simultaneously a moving love story and above all an ode to the love of cheese.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 order-0 order-sm-1 offset-lg-1 col-bleed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--dark m-entity a-focus\">\n    <h3>Please note</h3>\n    <p><em>This film is French with English subtitles.  </em></p>\n<p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. More information can be found <em><a href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\" id=\"menur60q\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\">here</a></em>. </p>\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event m-entity\">\n      <strong>Age - Rating TBC</strong>\n  \n  \n      <strong>Dates - <time datetime=\"2025-04-27T18:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">27 April 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-01T12:40:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">1 May 2025</time>\n</strong>\n  \n  \n  <hr>\n\n      <h3>£9 / £15</h3>\n  \n      \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content95ac2687-564b-43db-8f9d-049edbcc2e7a m-block__default-booking-information m-default-booking-information\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-booking-info\">\n  \n  </div>\n\t</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--highlight\">\n    \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contenta8df1267-4caa-41b6-842f-0230abfeeb5b m-block__friends-promo m-friends-promo\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Become a JW3 Friend and save up to 10% on events!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/memberships\" title=\"Membership\">Join now</a></p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event m-entity\">\n\n  \n      <h3 class=\"h5\">Type:</h3>\n      <a href=\"/whats-on?date=&genre[3]=3&type=All\" class=\"a-tag a-tag--cinema\"><svg width=\"39\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 39 38\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path fill=\"#EE7203\" d=\"M0 0h39v38H0z\"/><ellipse fill=\"#FFF\" cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"19.358\" rx=\"10.111\" ry=\"10.038\"/></g></svg>Cinema</a>\n\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t  \n\n</article>\n\t</div>\n\n\n  </main>\n\n<footer class=\"o-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n  <section class=\"o-footer__top\">\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\n        <div class=\"o-footer__top-inner\">\n          \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contentb99bc602-5791-4ff9-a92d-61be3be0bc59 m-block__footer---box-office m-footer---box-office\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Box Office</h3>\n<p>(020) 7433 8988</p>\n<p>341-351 Finchley Road, London, NW3 6ET</p>\n<p>JW3 - Helping to create a vibrant, diverse and proud community, inspired by and engaged in Jewish arts, culture and community</p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n          \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contentb1e46c97-db06-4c67-a5c1-b97f638629b4 m-block__footer---friends m-