        "response": {
          "bodySize": 9354,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 9354,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Inspired by the true story of a disillusioned Englishman who went to work in a school in Argentina in 1976. Expecting an easy ride, Tom discovers a divided nation and a class of unteachable students. However, after he rescues a penguin from an oil-slicked beach, his life is turned upside-down. | Rating: 12A, Duration: 1h 51m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 111,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/5ddc1fee-4806-4a11-ba2d-651ae4d81e8c.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The Penguin Lessons\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"4 May-8 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/5ddc1fee-4806-4a11-ba2d-651ae4d81e8c-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"506001AKBPBVBNBNBGQMMBGVTPJGNLMJD\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-04T11:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-08T19:30:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"506001AKBPBVBNBNBGQMMBGVTPJGNLMJD\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-05-04T11:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-05-04T10:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-23T12:08:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-23T11:08:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \