        "response": {
          "bodySize": 7374,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 7374,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"After 20 years away, Odysseus washes up on the shores of Ithaca, haggard and unrecognizable. The King has returned from the Trojan War, but much has changed in his kingdom. His beloved wife Penelope is a prisoner in her own home, hounded by suitors vying to be king. Their son Telemachus faces death at the hands of these suitors, who see him as merely an obstacle to their pursuit of the kingdom. Odysseus has also changed--scarred by his experience of the Trojan war, he is no longer the mighty warrior from years past--but he must rediscover his strength in order to win back all that he has lost. | Rating: 15, Duration: 1h 56m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 116,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/fd2b39b1-5f63-40ca-8cc8-55905240ebae.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The Return\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"4 May-8 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/fd2b39b1-5f63-40ca-8cc8-55905240ebae-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"506201ASQNHJPMVDNGRKSMHGTNSGCCLNM\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-04T14:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-08T16:30:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n 