rifying, never-before-seen material and newly restored footage of Lennon&#039;s only full-length, post-Beatles concert. With mind-blowing remastered audio overseen by their son, Sean Ono Lennon, the film is a seismic revelation that will challenge pre-existing notions of the iconic couple.\" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/one-one-john-yoko\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/one-one-john-yoko\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"One to One: John &amp; Yoko\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An expansive and revelatory inside look at the 18 months John Lennon and Yoko Ono spent living in Greenwich Village in the early 1970s. \nOne to One: John &amp; Yoko, delivers an immersive cinematic experience that brings to life electrifying, never-before-seen material and newly restored footage of Lennon&#039;s only full-length, post-Beatles concert. With mind-blowing remastered audio overseen by their son, Sean Ono Lennon, the film is a seismic revelation that will challenge pre-existing notions of the iconic couple.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/One%20to%20One%20John%20and%20Yoko.jpg?itok=giECRV6i\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-23T16:36:34+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"One to One: John &amp; Yoko | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/one-one-john-yoko\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/