evolves into a journey filled with unexpected challenges when they are faced with the reality of fertility treatments. An intimate and thought-provoking story that beautifully explores the complexities of love, hope, and the path to parenthood.\nFollowed by a Q&amp;A with director Erez Tadmor, and stars Roy Assaf and Nelly Tagar. \" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/art-waiting-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/art-waiting-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Art of Waiting + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Join us for a special retrospective honoring Director Erez Tadmor, featuring the powerful film The Art of Waiting. Follow Liran and Tali, a couple in their thirties with hopes of starting a family.\nWhat begins as a straightforward dream quickly evolves into a journey filled with unexpected challenges when they are faced with the reality of fertility treatments. An intimate and thought-provoking story that beautifully explores the complexities of love, hope, and the path to parenthood.\nFollowed by a Q&amp;A with director Erez Tadmor, and stars Roy Assaf and Nelly Tagar. \" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/The%20Art%20of%20Waiting_0.jpg?itok=J38sMdgh\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Art of Waiting + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/art-waiting-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\