turn, Libbi refuses to make room for her mother in her life. At the same time, Libbi harbors a secret dream that could jeopardize her chances of finding a suitable match.\nWe will be screening the first two episodes of Kugel, followed by a Q&amp;A with star Sasson Gabai. \" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Kugel + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The series explores the lives of Noacham Shtisel, a diamond dealer and the estranged brother of Shulem Shtisel, and his daughter Libbi, as they grapple with the departure of the family matriarch.\nWhile Noacham seeks forgiveness for his ex-wife in the hope that she will return, Libbi refuses to make room for her mother in her life. At the same time, Libbi harbors a secret dream that could jeopardize her chances of finding a suitable match.\nWe will be screening the first two episodes of Kugel, followed by a Q&amp;A with star Sasson Gabai. \" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=4MrnTKi3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Kugel + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/kugel-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=W97HhEK4\" />\n