     </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item menu-item--expanded\">\n        <a href=\"/about-us/people\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/352\">People</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/about-us/nursery\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/339\">Nursery</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.stories.jw3.org.uk/\">Our Stories</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.venuehire.jw3.org.uk/\">Venue Hire</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/jw3-tv\">JW3-TV</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n\n\n\n            <div class=\"m-main-nav__info\">\n              \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contentf59b977b-6bbe-4146-a768-f46e57892115 m-block__header---get-in-touch m-header---get-in-touch\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2>Get in touch</h2>\n<h3>Box office</h3>\n<h3>(020) 7433 8988</h3>\n<p>341-351 Finchley Road, London, NW3 6ET</p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n              \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content8d66a62c-9384-439f-bfbd-7f9314d82294 m-block__bottom-right-block m-bottom-right-block\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Café @ JW3</h3>\n<p>Our in-house coffee shop is located in the bottom floor of JW3's building, next to the Piazza. It's the perfect spot to enjoy a hot or cold drink, savoury snacks and morish sweet treats &amp; pastries. </p>\n<p><strong>Open Sunday to Thursday from 10am</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div class=\"m-search m-overlay\">\n    <section>\n      <div class=\"grid justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n          <div class=\"m-search__inner\">\n            <h4 class=\"h2 a-title\">Search<span>&#x25A0;</span></h4>\n            \n<div class=\"views-exposed-form bef-exposed-form m-block m-block--views m-block--views-exposed-filter-blocksearch-search m-block__ m-\" data-drupal-selector=\"views-exposed-form-search-search\">\n\t\t\t\t<form action=\"/search\" method=\"get\" id=\"views-exposed-form-search-search\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <div class=\"js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-for form-item-for\">\n      <label for=\"edit-for\">Search</label>\n        <input placeholder=\"Search JW3\" data-drupal-selector=\"edit-for\" type=\"text\" id=\"edit-for\" name=\"for\" value=\"\" size=\"30\" maxlength=\"128\" class=\"form-text\" />\n\n        </div>\n<div data-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions\"><button data-twig-suggestion=\"search_results_submit\" class=\"a-btn button js-form-submit form-submit\" value=\"Search\" data-drupal-selector=\"edit-submit-search\" type=\"submit\" id=\"edit-submit-search\">\n  Search\n</button>\n</div>\n\n</form>\n\n\t</div>\n\n            \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content82a51303-2ddf-433b-aba8-4c93be2d8770 m-block__search-suggestions m-search-suggestions\">\n\t\t\n      <h5>We suggest</h5>\n  \n      <div class=\"m-search__suggestions\">\n          <a href=\"/search?for=yom%20hazikaron\" title=\"\">Yom Hazikaron</a>\n    <a href=\"/search?for=summer%20ulpan\" title=\"\">Summer Ulpan</a>\n    <a href=\"/search?for=emma%20barnett\" title=\"\">Emma Barnett</a>\n    <a href=\"/search?for=british%20sign%20language\" title=\"\">British Sign Language</a>\n    <a href=\"/search?for=knitting%20pilgrim\" title=\"\">Knitting Pilgrim</a>\n    <a href=\"/search?for=middle%20east\" title=\"\">Middle East</a>\n\n    </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n</header>\n\n\n<div class=\"visually-hidden\">\n  <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<main role=\"main\" class=\"wrapper wapper--main\">\n        <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n<div id=\"block-mainpagecontent\" class=\"m-block m-block--system m-block--system-main-block m-block__ m-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<article  role=\"article\" about=\"/whats-on/kugel-qa\" class=\"o-node o-event o-full\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-banner m-banner--event\" role=\"banner\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"m-banner__copy\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t  <nav class=\"a-breadcrumb\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumb\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumb\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumb</h2>\n    <ol>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/whats-on\">What&#039;s On</a>\n              </li>\n          <li> Kugel + Q&amp;A</li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid align-end\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-lg-6 offset-lg-1\">\n\n                      Seret Film Festival 2025\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKugel + Q&amp;A\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                      קוגל\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>90 minutes</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>Sun 11 May 2025</span><span>7:30pm</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£16</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n        <div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 m-banner__links\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/ChooseSeats/880801\" class=\"a-btn\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t          <aside class=\"a-wishlist\"><span class=\"a-wishlist__msg\"></span><button class=\"a-wishlist__button\" title=\"Add to wishlist\" data-target=\"4433\">Add to wishlist</button></aside>\n        </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"m-banner__image a-image a-image--full\">\n\t\t\t\n\n<picture>\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_sm/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=ZAhSEV7Z\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 1000px)\" data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_md/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=U767FxqW\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image/public/images/Kugel.jpg?itok=L42E4MXj\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t<img data-src=\"\" alt=\"Kugel\" class=\"lazy lazy-animate\" />\n</picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"m-sticky-header\">\n\t<div class=\"grid justify-center\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"m-sticky-header__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Kugel + Q&amp;A</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><time datetime=\"2025-05-11T18:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">11 May 2025</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£16</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/ChooseSeats/880801\" class=\"a-btn\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-8 col-lg-6 order-1 order-sm-0 offset-lg-1\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-entity m-entity__body\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The series explores the lives of Noacham Shtisel, a diamond dealer and the estranged brother of Shulem Shtisel, and his daughter Libbi, as they grapple with the departure of the family matriarch.</p>\n<p>While Noacham seeks forgiveness for his ex-wife in the hope that she will return, Libbi refuses to make room for her mother in her life. At the same time, Libbi harbors a secret dream that could jeopardize her chances of finding a suitable match.</p>\n<p>We will be screening the first two episodes of Kugel, followed by a Q&amp;A with star Sasson Gabai. </p>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<section class=\"m-entity m-entity__accordion\">\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"js-accordion\">\n    <p class=\"js-accordion__header h3\">Credits</p>\n<div class=\"js-accordion__panel\">\n\t<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Drama, TV Series<br />\n<strong>Director:</strong> Erez Kav-El<br />\n<strong>Writer: </strong>Yehonatan Indursky<br />\n<strong>Producer:</strong> Abot Hameiri in collaboration with Israel's Yes network and streaming service IZZY.<br />\n<strong>Stars: </strong>Sasson Gabai, Hadas Yaron, Mili Avital</p>\n\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 order-0 order-sm-1 offset-lg-1 col-bleed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--dark m-entity a-focus\">\n    <h3>Please note</h3>\n    <p>This series is in Hebrew and Yiddish with English subtitles. </p>\n<p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. More information can be found <em><a href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\" id=\"menur60q\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\">here</a></em>. </p>\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event m-entity\">\n  \n  \n      <strong>Date - Sun 11 May 2025 7:30pm</strong>\n  \n  \n  <hr>\n\n      <h3>£16</h3>\n  \n      \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content95ac2687-564b-43db-8f9d-049edbcc2e7a m-block__default-booking-information m-default-booking-information\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-booking-info\">\n  \n  </div>\n\t</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--highlight\">\n    \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contenta8df1267-4caa-41b6-842f-0230abfeeb5b m-block__friends-promo m-friends-promo\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>Become a JW3 Friend and save up to 10% on events!</p>\n<p><a href=\"/memberships\" title=\"Membership\">Join now</a></p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event m-entity\">\n\n      <div class=\"o-sidebar__festival\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">Part of:</h3>\n      <div class=\"views-element-container\"><div class=\"view__festival_link m-entity m-entity__view\">\n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n\n    <div class=\"views-field views-field-title\"><span class=\"field-content\"><a href=\"/seret\" hreflang=\"en\">Seret Film Festival</a></span></div>\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n</div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n      <h3 class=\"h5\">Type:</h3>\n      <a href=\"/whats-on?date=&genre[3]=3&type=All\" class=\"a-tag a-tag--cinema\"><svg width=\"39\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 39 38\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path fill=\"#EE7203\" d=\"M0 0h39v38H0z\"/><ellipse fill=\"#FFF\" cx=\"19.5\" cy=\"19.358\" rx=\"10.111\" ry=\"10.038\"/></g></svg>Cinema</a>\n\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\n\t  \n\n</article>\n\t</div>\n\n\n  </main>\n\n<footer class=\"o-footer\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n  <section class=\"o-footer__top\">\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\n        <div class=\"o-footer__top-inner\">\n          \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contentb99bc602-5791-4ff9-a92d-61be3be0bc59 m-block__footer---box-office m-footer---box-office\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Box Office</h3>\n<p>(020) 7433 8988</p>\n<p>341-351 Finchley Road, London, NW3 6ET</p>\n<p>JW3 - Helping to create a vibrant, diverse and proud community, inspired by and engaged in Jewish arts, culture and community</p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n          \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contentb1e46c97-db06-4c67-a5c1-b97f638629b4 m-block__footer---friends m-footer---friends\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4>JW3 Friends Get More</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Save 10% on events, activities, classes &amp; courses</li>\n<li>Get a 10% discount at the Café</li>\n<li>Advance booking on selected events</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/memberships\" title=\"Membership\">JOIN NOW</a></strong></p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n          \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content8d66a62c-9384-439f-bfbd-7f9314d82294 m-block__bottom-right-block m-bottom-right-block\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Café @ JW3</h3>\n<p>Our in-house coffee shop is located in the bottom floor of JW3's building, next to the Piazza. It's the perfect spot to enjoy a hot or cold drink, savoury snacks and morish sweet treats &amp; pastries. </p>\n<p><strong>Open Sunday to Thursday from 10am</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\t</div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\n      <div class=\"m-footer-row m-footer-row--top\">\n        \n              <ul class=\"menu\">\n                    <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/about-us\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/338\">About us</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.venuehire.jw3.org.uk/\">Venue Hire</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/jw3-tv\">JW3-TV</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/your-visit/getting-us\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/328\">Getting to us</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/your-visit/box-office\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/325\">Contact us</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/support-us/volunteer\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/57\">Volunteer</a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n\n\n        \n<div cl