y’s respected leader and former resistance fighter. Torn between his growing passion for the woman and his duty to uncover the truth of her past, Shalom faces an emotional battle that could unravel everything. A compelling tale of love, loyalty, and moral conflict.\nFollowed by a Q&amp;A with director Erez Tadmor. \" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/soda-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/soda-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Soda + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Starring Lior Raz (Fauda) and Rotem Sela, this gripping drama is set in 1956, where a beautiful seamstress moves into a tight-knit neighborhood of Holocaust survivors.\nWhispers about her mysterious past as a Capo stir unrest, especially for Shalom, the community’s respected leader and former resistance fighter. Torn between his growing passion for the woman and his duty to uncover the truth of her past, Shalom faces an emotional battle that could unravel everything. A compelling tale of love, loyalty, and moral conflict.\nFollowed by a Q&amp;A with director Erez Tadmor. \" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Soda_web%20banner.jpg?itok=VyZNDEHw\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T17:32:28+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Soda + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/soda-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/