a&#039;s world is turned upside down when Orly Elimeleh, a beautiful and rebellious army widow, goes missing. As she digs deeper, Daphna is troubled by one question: why is no one searching for her? Driven by fear and determination, Daphna will stop at nothing to uncover the truth behind Orly&#039;s disappearance.\" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/highway-65-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/highway-65-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Highway 65 + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Starring Idan Ameady and Tali Sharon, this gripping mystery follows Daphna, a 41-year-old former promising detective in Tel Aviv now stuck in the quiet town of Afula.\nWith her days filled with petty crimes and awkward questions about not having children, Daphna&#039;s world is turned upside down when Orly Elimeleh, a beautiful and rebellious army widow, goes missing. As she digs deeper, Daphna is troubled by one question: why is no one searching for her? Driven by fear and determination, Daphna will stop at nothing to uncover the truth behind Orly&#039;s disappearance.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Highway%2065.jpg?itok=sP7Eq6LZ\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-22T10:33:00+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Highway 65 + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/highway-65-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"h