yond the fence, those thirsting for revenge, and those holding onto hope and humanity. A tense and emotional journey through chaos, where survival and compassion collide.\" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/dogs-and-men-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/dogs-and-men-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Of Dogs and Men + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Inspired by the harrowing events of 7/10, this gripping film follows 16-year-old Dar as she returns to her kibbutz in search of her lost dog amidst a terror spree.\nAs she navigates the horrors around her, Dar is caught between escalating violence beyond the fence, those thirsting for revenge, and those holding onto hope and humanity. A tense and emotional journey through chaos, where survival and compassion collide.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/Of%20Dogs%20and%20Men.jpg?itok=kULKItSI\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-02T16:34:22+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Of Dogs and Men + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/dogs-and-men-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/Of%20Dogs%20and%20Men.jpg?itok=8y7TztSN\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 9 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFrien