          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 3853,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The sequel to American Humane's award-winning documentary, Escape from Extinction, introduces rewilding - a proven method for sustainable conservation that has the potential to bring back hundreds of thousands of species from the brink of extinction. Narrated by Academy Award winner Meryl Streep, the film follows tireless conservation efforts of leading organizations implementing rewilding practices across a diverse array of species in equally diverse environments. | Duration: 1h 30m, Rating: 12 | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 90,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/6cdf757d-c34e-49fd-bb33-97a7d76c0fd8.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Escape from Extinction: Rewilding\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"14 May-15 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/6cdf757d-c34e-49fd-bb33-97a7d76c0fd8-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"507001AMQBGVVHKKTGJGPSKBPPTVHVGVL\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-14T11:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-15T13:15:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"507001AMQBGVVHKKTGJGPSKBPPTVHVGVL\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-05-14T11:30:00\",\n