            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 2562,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Parthenope, born in the sea of Naples in 1950, searches for happiness over the long summers of her youth, falling in love with her home city and its many memorable characters. From Academy Award-winning filmmaker Paolo Sorrentino comes a monumental and deeply romantic story of a lifetime. | This film is in Italian with English subtitles | Rating: 15, Duration: 2h 17m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 137,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/e0550577-35ca-49b3-9199-9922bffb4ba3.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Parthenope\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"14 May-14 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/e0550577-35ca-49b3-9199-9922bffb4ba3-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"507201AJPPDCLQQBJBDGQTSHPLGLBGHKV\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-14T14:20:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-14T14:20:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"507201AJPPDCLQQBJBDGQTSHPLGLBGHKV\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-05-14T14:20:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-05-14T13:20:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-23T15:19:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-23T14:19:0