        "response": {
          "bodySize": 8020,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 8020,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"As the star player at an elite youth tennis academy, Julie's life revolves around the game she loves. She trains hard, pausing only for class or physical therapy before returning to the gym fixated on making it into the Belgian Tennis Federation. When her coach Jérémy is suddenly suspended following the suicide of one of his female protégées, all the players at the academy are encouraged to speak up about their experiences with him. Julie, however, decides to keep quiet. Despite strong suspicions from those around her that Julie's relationship with Jérémy was inappropriate at best, her persistent silence begins to speak volumes. Confused and full of anxiety, the pressure she once channeled solely towards training shifts inward, affecting her confidence, her focus, and her game. Executive produced by tennis champion Naomi Osaka, Julie Keeps Quiet is a \\\"tense, taut, artfully hushed debut feature\\\" (Variety) by Belgian writer-director Leonardo van Dijl. Led by newcomer Tessa Van den Broeck whose performance embodies the different ways trauma is internalized, Julie Keeps Quiet respectfully and empathetically examines why some victims choose to remain silent. | This film is in French and Dutch with English subtitles | Rating: 12A, Duration: 1h30m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 100,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/8dbd0b6b-5455-4242-a7b7-56d92ede8f73.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Julie Keeps Quiet\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"18 May-22 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/8dbd0b6b-5455-4242-a7b7-56d92ede8f73-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  