            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 169695,
            "text": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"content: http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/  dc: http://purl.org/dc/terms/  foaf: http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/  og: http://ogp.me/ns#  rdfs: http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#  schema: http://schema.org/  sioc: http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#  sioct: http://rdfs.org/sioc/types#  skos: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#  xsd: http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema# \">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/last-musician-auschwitz-qa\" />\n<link rel=\"shortlink\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/node/4449\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Drupal 8 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<link rel=\"image_src\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image/public/images/The%20Last%20Musician%20of%20Auschwitz%20web%20banner%202_0.jpg?itok=25ac4uHY\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"How can there be music in the worst place in the world? The Last Musician of Auschwitz reveals how music became a lifeline and form of resistance amid the Holocaust&#039;s horrors.\nAt its center is 99-year-old cellist Anita Lasker-Wallfisch, the last living survivor from the camp orchestras, whose testimony frames this powerful documentary.\" />\n<meta name=\"abstract\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/last-musician-auschwitz-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"JW3\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/last-musician-auschwitz-qa\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Last Musician of Auschwitz + Q&amp;A\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"How can there be music in the worst place in the world? The Last Musician of Auschwitz reveals how music became a lifeline and form of resistance amid the Holocaust&#039;s horrors.\nAt its center is 99-year-old cellist Anita Lasker-Wallfisch, the last living survivor from the camp orchestras, whose testimony frames this powerful documentary.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_facebook/public/images/The%20Last%20Musician%20of%20Auschwitz%20web%20banner%202_0.jpg?itok=15RALOjs\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" />\n<meta property=\"og:updated_time\" content=\"2025-04-24T10:36:25+01:00\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@JW3London\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"The Last Musician of Auschwitz + Q&amp;A | JW3\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/last-musician-auschwitz-qa\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1500\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/meta_twitter/public/images/The%20Last%20Musician%20of%20Auschwitz%20web%20banner%202_0.jpg?itok=6M91ImdE\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 9 (https://www.drupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/themes/pippip/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n<link rel=\"revision\" href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/last-musician-auschwitz-qa\" />\n<script src=\"/sites/default/files/google_tag/jw3_gtm/google_tag.script.js?sv7jlw\" defer></script>\n\n    <title>The Last Musician of Auschwitz + Q&amp;A | JW3</title>\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"144x144\" href=\"/themes/pippip/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/themes/pippip/favicon-32x32.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/themes/pippip/favicon-16x16.png\">\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" hre