r>\n\n\n<div class=\"visually-hidden\">\n  <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n</div>\n\n<main role=\"main\" class=\"wrapper wapper--main\">\n        <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n<div id=\"block-mainpagecontent\" class=\"m-block m-block--system m-block--system-main-block m-block__ m-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<article  role=\"article\" about=\"/whats-on/exhibition-screen-michelangelo-love-and-death\" class=\"o-node o-event o-full\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-banner m-banner--event\" role=\"banner\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"m-banner__copy\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t  <nav class=\"a-breadcrumb\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumb\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumb\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumb</h2>\n    <ol>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/whats-on\">What&#039;s On</a>\n              </li>\n          <li> Exhibition on Screen: Michelangelo: Love and Death</li>\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid align-end\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-lg-6 offset-lg-1\">\n\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tExhibition on Screen: Michelangelo: Love and Death\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n          \n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>90 minutes</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>PG</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><time datetime=\"2025-05-20T13:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">20 May 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-29T12:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">29 May 2025</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£9 / £15</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n        <div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 offset-lg-1 m-banner__links\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/EventAvailability?EventId=506602&amp;ref=bookNow&amp;scroll=timeAndDates\" class=\"use-ajax a-btn\" data-dialog-type=\"modal\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;height&quot;:&quot;70%&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:&quot;80%&quot;}\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t          <aside class=\"a-wishlist\"><span class=\"a-wishlist__msg\"></span><button class=\"a-wishlist__button\" title=\"Add to wishlist\" data-target=\"4464\">Add to wishlist</button></aside>\n        </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"m-banner__image a-image a-image--full\">\n\t\t\t\n\n<picture>\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_sm/public/images/Exhibition%20on%20Screen%20Michaelangelo.jpg?itok=YUvkC0hh\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source media=\"(max-width: 1000px)\" data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image_md/public/images/Exhibition%20on%20Screen%20Michaelangelo.jpg?itok=-P-OY-mI\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t\t<source data-srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/banner_image/public/images/Exhibition%20on%20Screen%20Michaelangelo.jpg?itok=pNRU9q_-\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n\t<img data-src=\"\" alt=\"Michelangelo: Love and Death\" class=\"lazy lazy-animate\" />\n</picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"m-sticky-header\">\n\t<div class=\"grid justify-center\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"m-sticky-header__inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<aside>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Exhibition on Screen: Michelangelo: Love and Death</h2>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"o-event__details o-event__details-bold\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><time datetime=\"2025-05-20T13:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">20 May 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-29T12:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">29 May 2025</time>\n</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>£9 / £15</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</aside>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://purchase.jw3.org.uk/EventAvailability?EventId=506602&amp;ref=bookNow&amp;scroll=timeAndDates\" class=\"use-ajax a-btn\" data-dialog-type=\"modal\" data-dialog-options=\"{&quot;height&quot;:&quot;70%&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:&quot;80%&quot;}\">Book Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-8 col-md-8 col-lg-6 order-1 order-sm-0 offset-lg-1\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-entity m-entity__body\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The spectacular sculptures and paintings of Michelangelo seem so familiar to us, but what do we really know about this Renaissance giant?</p>\n<p>Michelangelo’s genius is evident in everything he touched. Beautiful and diverse works such as the towering statue of David, the moving Pietà in the Papal Basilica of St. Peter and his tour-de-force, the Sistine Chapel ceiling, still leave us breathless today. </p>\n<p>Spanning his 88 years, Michelangelo – Love and Death takes a cinematic journey through the print and drawing rooms of Europe through the great chapels and museums of Florence, Rome and the Vatican to seek out a deeper understanding of this legendary figure’s tempestuous life, his relationship with his contemporaries and his incredible legacy. </p>\n<p>Through expert commentary, stunning visuals and Michelangelo’s own words, this film takes a fresh look at a master artist whose life and genius are celebrated in every mark he made. Returning to cinemas in 2025 to celebrate this iconic artist’s 550th birthday. </p>\n<p>Sculptor, painter, architect, poet, genius – discover why Michelangelo is without a doubt one of the greatest artists of all time.</p>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n<section class=\"m-entity m-entity__video\">\n\n  \n    <h3 class=\"a-title\">Michelangelo: Love and Death<span>&#x25A0;</span></h3>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"video-embed-field-provider-youtube video-embed-field-responsive-video\"><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bm-d2p60lQ4?autoplay=0&amp;start=0&amp;rel=0\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n\n  \n\n\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"m-entity m-entity__accordion\">\n\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"js-accordion\">\n    <p class=\"js-accordion__header h3\">Credits</p>\n<div class=\"js-accordion__panel\">\n\t<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Documentary <br />\n<strong>Rating:</strong> PG <br />\n<strong>Director:</strong> David Bickerstaff </p>\n\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 col-lg-3 order-0 order-sm-1 offset-lg-1 col-bleed\">\n\t\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--dark m-entity a-focus\">\n    <h3>Please note</h3>\n    <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. More information can be found <em><a href=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\" id=\"menur60q\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/booking-and-security-fees\">here</a></em>. </p>\n\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event m-entity\">\n      <strong>Age - PG</strong>\n  \n  \n      <strong>Dates - <time datetime=\"2025-05-20T13:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">20 May 2025</time>\n - <time datetime=\"2025-05-29T12:30:00Z\" class=\"datetime\">29 May 2025</time>\n</strong>\n  \n  \n  <hr>\n\n      <h3>£9 / £15</h3>\n  \n      \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-content95ac2687-564b-43db-8f9d-049edbcc2e7a m-block__default-booking-information m-default-booking-information\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"m-booking-info\">\n  \n  </div>\n\t</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"o-sidebar o-sidebar--event o-sidebar--highlight\">\n    \n<div class=\"m-block m-block--block-content m-block--block-contenta8df1267-4caa-41b6-842f-0230abfeeb5b m-block__fr