        "response": {
          "bodySize": 5710,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 5710,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The spectacular sculptures and paintings of Michelangelo seem so familiar to us, but what do we really know about this Renaissance giant? Michelangelo’s genius is evident in everything he touched. Beautiful and diverse works such as the towering statue of David, the moving Pietà in the Papal Basilica of St. Peter and his tour-de-force, the Sistine Chapel ceiling, still leave us breathless today. \\r\\n\\r\\nSpanning his 88 years, Michelangelo – Love and Death takes a cinematic journey through the print and drawing rooms of Europe through the great chapels and museums of Florence, Rome and the Vatican to seek out a deeper understanding of this legendary figure’s tempestuous life, his relationship with his contemporaries and his incredible legacy. \\r\\n\\r\\nThrough expert commentary, stunning visuals and Michelangelo’s own words, this film takes a fresh look at a master artist whose life and genius are celebrated in every mark he made. Returning to cinemas in 2025 to celebrate this iconic artist’s 550th birthday. \\r\\n\\r\\nSculptor, painter, architect, poet, genius – discover why Michelangelo is without a doubt one of the greatest artists of all time. | Rating: PG, Duration: 1h 30 | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 90,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/7a5f97c8-5f43-4317-bee3-2ddf14a0b61f.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Exhibition on Screen: Michelangelo: Love and Death\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"20 May-29 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/7a5f97c8-5f43-4317-bee3-2ddf14a0b61f-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"506602AGCTTNDJPTCKCDHLJ