            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 2611,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"A live-action musical reimagining of the classic 1937 film. Starring Rachel Zegler in the title role and Gal Gadot as her Stepmother, the Evil Queen, the magical music adventure journeys back to the timeless story with beloved characters Bashful, Doc, Dopey, Grumpy, Happy, Sleepy, and Sneezy. | This screening is exclusively for parents or carers with a baby under one. | Rating: PG, Duration: 1h 49m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time.\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 109,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/f6f92e78-51e2-47d5-a854-977fb08e2390.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Babykino: Snow White\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"26 May-26 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/f6f92e78-51e2-47d5-a854-977fb08e2390-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"508601AKKNLSBBKHPDJNBLNMMVKSMQQSR\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-26T10:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-26T10:30:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"Babykino\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"508601AKKNLSBBKHPDJNBLNMMVKSMQQSR\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-05-26T10:30:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-05-26T09:30:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-23T15:43:00\",\n   