            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 5944,
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"A group of clever East Germans seizes the chaotic post-GDR era in 1990 to retrieve hidden millions from an underground vault. As they outsmart formidable opponents, the heist takes an unexpected turn when money officially unrecognized in the GDR circulates. | This film is in German with English subtitles | Rating: 12A, Duration: 1h 53m | Films may be preceded by up to 20 minutes of advertisements and trailers. Specific timings will vary with each screening. We always recommend arriving on time. \",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 113,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/9df417da-3cc9-4806-9068-5a0e77296183.jpg\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Two to One\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"26 May-29 May\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://sysfilessacbe149174fee.blob.core.windows.net/public-container/clients/jw3/files/9df417da-3cc9-4806-9068-5a0e77296183-thumbnail.jpg\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"507801ADMQGVJJJLQBJMGTPQCVPGVMTHJ\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-26T16:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2025-05-29T20:10:00\",\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"149401ALSPNQKBLRBDJBKVKJLTNBBJLMB\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"507801ADMQGVJJJLQBJMGTPQCVPGVMTHJ\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2025-05-26T16:30:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2025-05-26T15:30:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2025-04-23T15:54:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2025-04-23T14:54:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\